title: Start
---
<<background bg.day>>
<<move left 0.25 0.5 1 1 0>>
<<move right 0.75 0.5 1 1 0>>
<<show left actor.alice 500>>
<<show right actor.bob 500>>
<<music audio.music 1000>>
<<ambience audio.ambience 1000>>
<<voice audio.voice 250>>
<<effect audio.effect 250>>
Guide: Day background and two characters fade in. Music and ambience loop; voice and effect are one-shots. Open Volume to mute each channel or master.
<<move left 0.4 0.4 1.4 0.6 1500>>
<<show background bg.night 1500>>
Guide: The background crossfades to night. The left character moves, scales and becomes partly transparent over 1.5 seconds.
<<show cg cg.sun 1000>>
Guide: The CG fades over the character layer. Advance after one second.
<<show overlay overlay.tint 1000>>
Guide: A decorative tint overlay fades above the CG. It does not block clicks. The Volume overlay is separate and modal.
<<hide overlay 1000>>
<<hide cg 1000>>
<<move left 0.25 0.5 1 1 1000>>
<<effect audio.effect 500>>
Guide: CG and tint fade out; the character returns. The effect fades in. Music and ambience continue so channel volume can be checked.
<<music none 1500>>
<<ambience none 1500>>
<<voice audio.voice 500>>
<<effect audio.effect 500>>
Guide: Music and ambience fade out; voice and effects fade in. Advance immediately to hear them fade out too.
<<voice none 750>>
<<effect none 750>>
<<hide left 1000>>
<<hide right 1000>>
Guide: Both characters and the remaining audio fade out. Background stays. Native actual results belong to maintainer issue 5.
===
